  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "ELIXIR's canonical registry for bioinformatics and life science software — 33,000+ tools, fully public REST API, EDAM-classified, CC-BY-SA-4.0. A ready-made discovery pipeline for MACH's Phase 2 harvester: query by topic (e.g. 'Medical informatics') to surface healthcare-adjacent tool candidates. EDAM topic and operation terms are a reference vocabulary for MACH's own clinical domain classifier. Cross-referencing MACH entries with their biotoolsID provides free enrichment (publications, operations metadata). Adopt as a harvester source and schema reference.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-29",
